    <string name="pp_last_updated">Last updated: %1$s</string>
    <string name="pp_short_body">Konstant works entirely on your phone. It has no account, no ads, no analytics and no tracking. The app does not have Android\'s internet permission, so it cannot send anything anywhere.</string>
    <string name="pp_location_body">If you allow it, the app uses your location to show where you are on the map, to find stops near you and to plan routes from your position. Your location is used only on the phone and is never stored or shared. You can turn it off at any time in Settings → Location; everything else keeps working.</string>
    <string name="pp_saved_body">Your saved places, saved stops and recent searches, and your route preference. They stay on your phone and are deleted when you uninstall the app. If you use Android\'s backup, they can be included in your own backup; timetable and map data are not.</string>
    <string name="pp_internet_body">The app never connects to the internet: timetable, map and places are built into the app and arrive with app updates.</string>
    <string name="pp_sources_body">Timetable: NVBW GmbH (Datenlizenz Deutschland 2.0). Map, places and streets: © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Bus stops: Stadt Konstanz. Using this data does not involve any of your personal data.</string>
